  "content": "<center><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/sJcvkhDc/images/ffa7bc514f15281edf7e1b1462cabaef0d40c11e.png\" alt=\"神秘村莊\" width=\"600\"/></center>\n\n<hr>\n\n蒼白花園生態域已有人跡。各式奇異神秘的建築潛伏於林木之間。\n\n若你撥開周圍可疑的砂礫，或許能發現答案⋯⋯尤其在夜晚時分。彷彿這片森林正獎勵著勇氣⋯⋯\n\n<center><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/Xq1JfTc9/optimized.gif\" alt=\"日夜戰利品變化GIF\" width=\"500\"/></center>\n\n<hr>\n\n<center>目前共 <strong>12</strong> 種建築結構，含 <strong>26</strong> 種獨特變體。更多範例請參閱<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/pale-formations/gallery\">作品集</a>。</center>\n\n<br>\n\n<center><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/sJcvkhDc/images/a5e0131c8034021c6221061b7ca2ce3e90dd2797.png\" alt=\"水坑\" width=\"600\"/></center>\n\n<hr>\n\n<center><a href=\"https://shop.purehosted.net/aff/wabi\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/089be7d8354008c5559afdaa2d957a9afb06f47d_0.webp\" alt=\"purehosted伺服器9折優惠券，pale formations定制\" width=\"600\"/></a></center>\n\n<hr>\n\n### 看看我們的其他作品！\n\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/wabi-sabi-structures\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/db2c10d25e12c6023e03d3771113e2096cc82bd3.png\" alt=\"侘寂建築\" width=\"32\"/><strong> 侘寂建築</strong></a>\n\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/revamped-shipwrecks\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/97f03f6580398b9e8014cce9a90ce4938f8d5451.png\" alt=\"革新沉船\" width=\"32\"/><strong> 革新沉船</strong></a>\n\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/unwrecked-ships\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/222ee3a9b426b4cfaf8b967c0e02a730e5eb9294.png\" alt=\"未損船隻\" width=\"32\"/><strong> 未損船隻</strong></a>",
